  "description": "An implementation of the iroh-gossip protocol providing efficient message dissemination via epidemic broadcast trees. It leverages the HyParView membership protocol for robust peer sampling and the PlumTree algorithm for tree-based gossip, offering a tiered architecture with an IO-less state machine and an optional networking layer integrated with iroh-net.",
